WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.440
«It's yet another artificial intelligence.

2
00:00:02.490 --> 00:00:04.670
You can tell a robot wrote it.»

3
00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:07.160
About copy-paste messages, you're right.

4
00:00:07.210 --> 00:00:09.300
People spot them in seven seconds

5
00:00:09.350 --> 00:00:11.360
and close the door forever.

6
00:00:11.410 --> 00:00:14.410
RelAI starts from your real messages

7
00:00:14.460 --> 00:00:15.920
and learns how you write.

8
00:00:15.970 --> 00:00:20.860
In Personalisation you tell it what you always say and what you'd never say.

9
00:00:20.910 --> 00:00:24.390
Every message starts from a real fact about that person

10
00:00:24.440 --> 00:00:27.360
and asks one question only. It makes nothing up.

11
00:00:27.410 --> 00:00:29.640
Salesman phrases are banned:

12
00:00:29.690 --> 00:00:31.380
«you crossed my mind»

13
00:00:31.430 --> 00:00:35.410
it never writes that. You read, tweak, send.

14
00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:38.300
If it doesn't sound like you, tell it and it rewrites it.

15
00:00:38.350 --> 00:00:43.530
The acid test: if the message still works when you change the name, redo it.

16
00:00:43.580 --> 00:00:46.160
Artificial intelligence stays behind.

17
00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:48.300
You're the one in front.
